<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>{{subject}}</title>
  <style>
    body {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      background-color: #FAF8F5;
      font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
      color: #3A302C;
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
    }
    .email-wrapper {
      width: 100%;
      background-color: #FAF8F5;
      padding: 32px 16px;
    }
    .email-container {
      max-width: 580px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      background-color: #FFFFFF;
      border: 1px solid #ECE5DE;
      border-radius: 16px;
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(58, 48, 44, 0.04);
    }
    .email-header {
      padding: 28px 32px 20px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #ECE5DE;
      background-color: #FAF8F5;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .brand-title {
      font-family: 'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif;
      font-size: 22px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #3A302C;
      letter-spacing: -0.01em;
      margin: 0;
    }
    .email-body {
      padding: 32px;
      font-size: 14px;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: #73635C;
    }
    .email-footer {
      padding: 24px 32px;
      background-color: #FAF8F5;
      border-top: 1px solid #ECE5DE;
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #A89B95;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }
    .cta-button {
      display: inline-block;
      background-color: #B86B70;
      color: #FFFFFF !important;
      text-decoration: none;
      padding: 12px 28px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 14px;
      text-align: center;
      transition: background-color 0.2s ease;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="email-wrapper">
    <div class="email-container">
      <div class="email-header">
        <h1 class="brand-title">{{appName}}</h1>
      </div>
      <div class="email-body">
        {{{bodyContent}}}
      </div>
      <div class="email-footer">
        <p style="margin: 0 0 8px;">
          Email ini dikirim secara otomatis oleh <strong>{{appName}}</strong>. Jangan membalas email ini secara langsung.
        </p>
        <p style="margin: 0;">
          &copy; {{currentYear}} {{appName}}. Seluruh hak cipta dilindungi.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
